This project ("tdeck-max-phone") combines original work with a vendored SIP
message parser ported from the sibling "tincan" project. Both are licensed
under the MIT License below.

Copyright (c) 2026 GlomarGadaffi
    tdeck-max-phone — LilyGO T-Deck MAX SIP phone firmware: hardware
    drivers, SIP user-agent client/server (tincan_uac, ported from tincan's
    sip_uac with inbound-call support added), G.711 codec and RTP (ported
    verbatim from tincan), Wi-Fi, and application code.

Copyright (c) 2022 BarGabriel / GlomarGadaffi
    components/sip_core — vendored from the "pocket-dial" project via
    tincan, used here as a SIP message/SDP parser and serializer.

